                  <rules>
                    <rule id="5e66-32aa-1db2-25bb" name="Standard Transport" hidden="false">
                      <description>Add enough Rhino Armoured Carriers to transport the entire formation after all other upgrades are chosen. Each Rhino carries 2 Tactical-sized units; one of them may be a Damocles Command Rhino. The count is set from the formation; add this upgrade last, or adjust the transports if you change units afterwards.</description>
                    </rule>
